cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Kavier in academic work, please cite the Kavier thesis
  (preferred-citation below). Cite this file when you need to refer to a
  specific released version of the software itself.
title: Kavier
abstract: >-
  Kavier simulates the performance, sustainability, and efficiency of LLM
  ecosystems under inference and training: inference latencies, training
  throughput, GPU utilization and Model FLOPs Utilization, energy consumption,
  carbon emissions, and cost per token or sample.
type: software
version: 0.5.1
date-released: "2026-09-16"
license: MIT
